cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it together with the WarpFactory paper
  listed under references, on which it is based.
title: warpica
abstract: >-
  Python port of the MATLAB WarpFactory toolkit: numerical spacetime metrics,
  stress-energy tensors and sampled energy-condition analysis.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Cini
    given-names: Francesco
repository-code: "https://github.com/Francesco-Cini/warpica"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - general relativity
  - warp drive
  - energy conditions
  - numerical relativity
# version and date-released are set when 1.0.0 is released.
references:
